---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Technical consulting"
  description="ArborSpace for technical consulting firms: capture what your experts know and apply it to every engagement."
  eyebrow="Solutions · Technical consulting"
  heading="Reuse what your experts already know."
  lead="A consulting firm sells the judgement of its experts. ArborSpace writes that judgement down as rules the system can apply and your teams can review."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>From experience to rules</h2>
        <p>
          The firm declares its vocabulary in the ontology, then writes down what its experts
          check, engagement after engagement, as declarative rules.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Every conclusion, reviewed</h2>
        <p>
          Rules produce findings in a review queue. The expert approves or rejects each one, and
          that decision feeds the memory for the next engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
